      "created_at": "2020-01-07T13:42:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was surprisingly easy! I think I had to kill the boat all of twice, and I always had enough environment and ongoing destruction to avoid the worst stuff. Maybe various Ley-Line Shifts helped? Swapping Lifeline back and forth between his variants was really great for overall performance.</p>",
