      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-01-08T03:23:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint here, final HP 17/16/13. Spread out the damage to make sure Mabel dropped and the boat was in trouble going into the environment turn, and I was rewarded for it. Never saw the boat again and we pounded La Capitan into the dirt over the next four rounds. Lifeline couldn't use powers twice, but that didn't seem too awful since I had Terminarch's Casing and Cosmic Immolation out for 4 end of turn damage anyway.</p>",
